So many of my works depressing.
That's not who I am
but I write most when I feel low.
It always feels like I'm regressing;
I can't see past them - 
But I only write when I feel low.

Writing now in prose most often
letters, notes, stories, instructions.
But when I sit to write I soften
unable to see past mind's deep junctions.

I'm happy in my day-to-day
so poetry has gone away.
Now, instead, I'll bring it back
and find the joy my writing lacked.
